---
// Move 1. States the problem and points at the one thing that is real and
// shipping today: the benchmark. The old primary CTA promised a pull-request
// verifier we cannot run yet; that is now a labelled waitlist further down the
// page. The certificate illustration that used to sit here is gone with the
// explainer, so the headline keeps the width.
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">Independent verification for AI-authored code</p>

      <h1 class="h1 hero-h1 reveal mt-6" style="--reveal-delay:60ms">
        Your AI fixed it. We check whether it actually did.
      </h1>

      <p class="lede reveal mt-8" style="--reveal-delay:120ms">
        AI writes and merges its own security fixes now, and most of them do close the hole.
        The one that ships broken is the fix that closes the hole and quietly rejects an input
        your tests never covered: the scanner goes green, the tests pass, and it merges. Assay
        is the independent check that runs what your tests leave out.
      </p>

      <div class="reveal mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-3" style="--reveal-delay:180ms">
        <a href="/benchmark" class="btn btn-primary">Run the benchmark</a>
        <a href="/the-index" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the Index</a>
      </div>

      <p class="mono reveal mt-6 text-[12px] text-fg-2" style="--reveal-delay:240ms">
        Free and open &middot; Four SQL injection flaws &middot; Bring any fixer
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-block: 64px 72px;
  }

  /* Full display size. The stage 2 rebuild took the headline from 80 to 72
     because it had to share the row with the certificate and still fit the
     viewport. That constraint is gone with the column, so the size comes
     back with it. 22ch lets the line set to two lines across the shell at
     1512, breaking after "check" rather than after "We". */
  .hero-h1 {
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6.4vw, 80px);
    max-width: 22ch;
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .hero {
      padding-block: 96px 104px;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) and (max-height: 760px) {
    .hero {
      padding-block: 64px 72px;
    }
  }
</style>
